OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F316A1785955700
OL,3,COspreys and Scarlets face uncertain
OL,4,Cfuture after latest update from WRU
OL,6,FThe next steps in streamlining the
OL,7,Ffuture of Welsh rugby have been
OL,8,Foutlined, with Swansea's Ospreys and
OL,9,FLlanelli's Scarlets in competition to
OL,10,Fkeep their professional status.
OL,12,FThe Welsh Rugby Union (WRU) has
OL,13,Fconfirmed its plans to establish three
OL,14,Fmen's professional teams, with Dragons
OL,15,FRFC and Cardiff Rugby offered the
OL,16,Frespective east and capital licenses.
OL,18,FThe remaining license is in the west,
OL,19,Fwith the process to allocate that
OL,20,Flicense expected to conclude by the
OL,21,Fend of the 2026/2027 season.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G1/4
