OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,317,300,200,120,000,100
PN,31602
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F316A1785955700
OL,3,COspreys and Scarlets face uncertain
OL,4,Cfuture after latest update from WRU
OL,6,FThe Vice Chair of the union, John
OL,7,FManders said: "We are making important
OL,8,Fprogress which will safeguard the
OL,9,Ffuture of our game, concentrate
OL,10,Fresources and give our teams the best
OL,11,Fchance of achieving success at all
OL,12,Flevels."
OL,14,FMarianne Okland, Chair of the
OL,15,FProfessional Rugby Board, said the
OL,16,Fgoal is to progress as quickly as
OL,17,Fpossible to ensure stability.
OL,26,@vD@Jot
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G2/4
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,317,300,200,120,000,100
PN,31603
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F316A1785955700
OL,3,COspreys and Scarlets face uncertain
OL,4,Cfuture after latest update from WRU
OL,6,F"The aim is to finalise the new
OL,7,Flicensing model as quickly as possible
OL,8,Fand then move quickly to confirm
OL,9,Ffuture licence arrangements and
OL,10,Ftransition plans. This will allow an
OL,11,Forderly implementation and avoid
OL,12,Fprolonged uncertainty for clubs,
OL,13,Fplayers, supporters, investors and
OL,14,Fsponsors."
OL,16,F"Assuming that Cardiff Rugby and
OL,17,FDragons RFC want to sign up to the
OL,18,Fproposed licensing terms, there is now
OL,19,Fcertainty that they will be offered
OL,20,Fthe capital and east licences
OL,21,Frespectively.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G3/4
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,317,300,200,120,000,100
PN,31604
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F316A1785955700
OL,3,COspreys and Scarlets face uncertain
OL,4,Cfuture after latest update from WRU
OL,6,F"We understand that there will be
OL,7,Fongoing uncertainty until a final
OL,8,Fdecision on the west licence is made.
OL,9,FThat is why we are committed to
OL,10,Fprogressing in a collaborative way,
OL,11,Fwhilst not underestimating the
OL,12,Fconsiderable challenges ahead, and
OL,13,Fproviding stability for all at the
OL,14,Fearliest opportunity."
